      "description": "<p>[By the Studio that brought you &lt;<strong><em>The Regressed Mercenary's Machinations</em></strong> and <strong><em>A Regressor’s Tale of Cultivation</em></strong>&gt;</p><p><br>Roberta, a priestess of the church, is designated as the head priestess of a remote region in the northern edge—Dithmar.</p><p>As the appointment came immediately after the disappearance of her predecessor, Roberta remained on guard and began to investigate Duke Ulrich of Dithmarschen.</p><p>According to rumors, he has ruled over the region's lord for over 300 years, and even claimed to be an immortal... one who lives a life no human should be capable of possessing.</p><p>Determined to uncover the truth, Roberta decides to trace his steps.<br></p>",
